# The build stage copies exactly: gradle/, gradlew, *.gradle.kts, gradle.properties,
# models/checksums.sha256 and src/. Everything else is dead weight in the build context —
# without this file every build uploaded ~250 MB (the local model, build output, .git, notes).
*
!gradle/
!gradlew
!settings.gradle.kts
!build.gradle.kts
!gradle.properties
!models/checksums.sha256
!src/
